WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:12.060
Congratulations fellow citizens! 3023 will go
down in history as the year we triumphed over

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.770
Covid-19.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.510
We interrupt the triumph over Covid-19 for a
special report. A new virus.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:24.590
Oh, for Pete's sake.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:30.620
A new virus dubbed EXPLOVID-23 has broken
out among the mutants who dwell beneath New

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:31.340
New York.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:36.590
Symptoms include blinding, uncontrollable
anger, as well as a mild cough, which I don't

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.620
have. I'm fine.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:42.830
A complete travel ban to and from the sewers
is being enforced by the city's fattest

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.270
police officers.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:47.270
Bye, mom. Bye, dad. Love you.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.880
Always with the love.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.460
We already hugged you, now we got to talk about it?

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:57.740
Sorry I'm late. What?

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.110
Let's move, you sofa snails! We've got a
delivery.

